182 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 52 0 R/T(Begin in box position, with your baby underneath you so you can make eye contact easily. As you exhale round the spine so the chin moves towards the chest and gently draw the abdominal muscles into the spine. Now slowly move the spine in the opposite direction, being careful not to compress the lower back. Move the chin away from the the chest and feel the spine lengthen. Draw the shoulders away from the ears. Repeat 3-5 times. )/E(Begin in box position, with your baby underneath you so you can make eye contact easily. As you exhale round the spine so the chin moves towards the chest and gently draw the abdominal muscles into the spine. Now slowly move the spine in the opposite direction, being careful not to compress the lower back. Move the chin away from the the chest and feel the spine lengthen. Draw the shoulders away from the ears. Repeat 3-5 times. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[7]>>
