endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 53 0 R/E(Progression: Add in Eagle arms as well. On an inhale take the arms out wide. As you exhale cross left under right. Bringing the hands together, back to back or palm to palm. Inhale to lift the elbows and hands away from the face. Exhale to sit a little deeper. Repeat on the opposite side. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

