212 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 53 0 R/E(Hold your baby in towards you with your feet a little wider than hip width apart. Press your feet firmly into the floor and draw the abdominal muscles towards the spine, Bend the knees and tilt the pelvis forward. Slowly straighten the legs, Repeat 6-8 times. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[12]>>
