<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 55 0 R/T(Place your baby next to you on your mat/their blanket and slowly roll onto your left hand side to face them. Bend your legs and reach your arms out directly in front of you at shoulder height. Slowly lift the right arm up towards the ceiling, following the arm with your gaze. Allow the arm to stretch out behind you, letting the upper body rotate a little at the same time. Feel the stretch across the chest. Slowly bring the hands back together, repeat 8 times on each side.)/E(Place your baby next to you on your mat/their blanket and slowly roll onto your left hand side to face them. Bend your legs and reach your arms out directly in front of you at shoulder height. Slowly lift the right arm up towards the ceiling, following the arm with your gaze. Allow the arm to stretch out behind you, letting the upper body rotate a little at the same time. Feel the stretch across the chest. Slowly bring the hands back together, repeat 8 times on each side.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]>>
