238 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 55 0 R/E(Now bend your knees and align the feet so the ankles are directly under your knees with your feet about hip width apart. Holding your baby firmly as you exhale lift the hips and spine up to create a bridge position. Lift high enough so that you feel the glutes working and try and engage the pelvic floor as you lift. Now slowly lower the hips and spine back down to the floor. Keep the feet flat on the floor to avoid any undue tension in the lower back. You may also like to have a cushion under your head for extra comfort. Repeat 8-10 times.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

